<title>USA: Waveland, Miss., won by Merchants. [CORRECTED 19:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>Waveland, Miss., won by Merchants. [CORRECTED 19:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merchants Bank (corrects from Trustmark National Bank) said it won $1.250 million of Waveland, Miss., general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.875 (corrects from 5.026) percent.</p>
</text>
